.*
.* A menu panel group, which is what the CRTMNU command compiles.
.*
.* Member: PNLMENU
.* Source: Application Display Programming SC41-5715 (V6R1), appendix A.
.* Retrieved: 2026-07-28
.*
:pnlgrp.
.*
.* From "Example: Panel Definition" in the reference.
:panel name=main
       help=hmain
       panelid=zmenu
       keyl=small
       .My Main Menu
:menu depth='*'.
:topinst.Select one of the following:
:menui help=MNUSER option=1
       action='CMD MENU X'
       .Display menu X
:menui help=MNSYS
       option=2
       action='CMD MENU SYSOPR'
       .System operations
:menui help=MNOFF
       option=90
       action='CMD SIGNOFF'
       .Sign off
:emenu.
:cmdline size=long.Selection or command
:epanel.
.*
.* MI is the short spelling of MENUI, and a menu group holds
.* the items shown together.
:panel name=admin help=hadmin keyl=small.Administration
:menu depth='*'.
:menugrp cond=isadmin.
:mi help=MNJOB option=1 action='CMD WRKACTJOB'.Work with jobs
:emenugrp.
:emenu.
:epanel.
:epnlgrp.
